                "text": "Maryland\u2019s families & communities have been ravaged by the opioid epidemic. We need solutions now. I\u2019m working to eliminate barriers to treatment, and I support legislation like the Mainstreaming Addiction Treatment Act to help get this done. https://t.co/n17ld4wSWp",
