                "text": "Treatment for Sickle Cell should be accessible to all who need it, but for too long that hasn\u2019t been the case for young patients transitioning out of pediatric care. That\u2019s why today @SenBooker & intro\u2019d the Sickle Cell Care Expansion Act so we can finally close the care gap. https://t.co/wH5zE4d753",
