                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Declaring bankruptcy.\u00a0\nForgoing medical treatment.\u00a0\nLiquidating their retirement.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nAmericans shouldn\u2019t\u00a0have to go to these extreme lengths to get out of medical debt. We can & we must do more.\u00a0And a good start would be taking up the bills I\u2019ve introduced\u00a0to tackle this crisis.",
