                "text": "Advancements in the treatment of sickle cell disease wouldn't be possible without the courage of MD brothers John & Brett Paul. Alongside the @hopkinsheme team I met with their family today, & shared our deep gratitude \u2013 we will never forget John\u2019s & Brett\u2019s extraordinary legacy. https://t.co/bnk5hk3QCI",
